%% Sequence 09d1 — Save talent bookmark
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin saves one candidate.
%% Evidence status: Implemented. Bookmark creates no proposal, invitation, or assignment.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Organization owner / admin
    participant B as «boundary» RecruiterBookmarksController
    participant O as «query» RecruitingDirectoryAccessQuery
    participant K as «control» CreateRecruiterBookmarkCommand
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL

    R->>B: POST /api/v1/me/organizations/current/talents/:userId/bookmarks
    activate B
    B->>O: canAccess(current organization, actor)
    O-->>B: Allowed or forbidden
    alt Organization owner/admin access allowed
        B->>K: handle(talentUserId, notes, folder, rating)
        activate K
        K->>D: Validate ownership and insert recruiter_bookmarks
        D-->>K: Bookmark record
        K-->>B: Bookmark result
        deactivate K
        B-->>R: Bookmark JSON
    else Access denied
        B-->>R: Policy error
    end
    deactivate B
